| 3 (1/4) | 192.192.20.128 | /26 | 192.192.20.191 |
| 4 (1/16) | 192.192.20.192 | /28 | 192.192.20.207 |
| 5 (1/16) | 192.192.20.208 | /28 | 192.192.20.223 |

Frei: .224 - .255

